The facility registries (data/shared/lookups/facility_registry.csv and
outputs/pakemis_facility_registry.csv) retain their per-row licence column. Counts
are generated from their current contents in the deposit manifest, not fixed in
this licence text. They are packaged as mixed databases in the ODbL companion.
ADS-B pilot derivatives (adsblol_pilot_fy2023_24.json), preserved release baselines
and spatial descendants without an independently cleared lineage are also kept
in the companion. Preservation does not relabel upstream-derived records as
solely this project's own work. Original contents licences remain in effect.

The compatible primary is regenerated without ODbL coordinates, rail/yard
geometry, landfill polygons or diagnostic road/building weights. Its supported
scopes and exclusions are recorded in pakemis_primary_geography_licence_audit.csv;
NetCDFs declare their geographic_licence_basis. The fixed or substituted geography
and unallocated mass remain scientific limitations, not observed locations.

